      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "THE GATEWAY SEES THREE REQUESTS\nIt does not know they belong to one question.\nEach one passes guard, tenant window, admit,\nplace and queue, and each one can be refused.\nHeaders on every call: X-Tenant,\nX-Request-Class: interactive  (app/lifespan.py)",
