      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "THE CONTEXT GROWS, THE START STAYS\nCall 3 = Tutor prompt + tools + question\n         + tool call + passages.\nThe start is identical on every Tutor call:\nthat is what the engine's prefix cache reuses\n(~97 % prefix-cache hits).",
