      "locked": false,
      "text": "TWO PREFIXES, NOT ONE\nRouter and Tutor have different system prompts.\nCall 1 shares its prefix with other Router calls,\ncalls 2 and 3 with other Tutor calls.\nUnique per turn: the question, the tool call,\nthe passages, the answer.",
